cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "Mapping unmanaged waste in an informal settlement from ultra-fine-resolution drone imagery"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code and dataset for mapping unmanaged waste piles in Ndirande,
  Blantyre, Malawi, from 3.81 cm drone imagery. Compares a GeoBIA baseline, a
  U-Net trained from scratch, and six pretrained and foundation-model backbones
  (ImageNet, OpenEarthMap, DINOv3, DINOv3-SAT, SatlasPretrain) across four label
  budgets, frozen and fine-tuned, with pixel-level and object-level evaluation
  and an explicit treatment of the prevalence shift between development and
  deployment.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Kalonde
    given-names: Patrick
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Kalondepatrick/mapping-waste-urban-africa"
keywords:
